			"Message": "docs(Rest): Add system architecture diagram to README\n\nAdd a comprehensive Mermaid architecture diagram covering the Rest compilation pipeline, its integration with the Output build system, and downstream consumers. The diagram documents:\n\n- The Fn/OXC compilation pipeline (Parser → Transformer → Codegen) orchestrated by Compiler.rs\n- The Struct/ configuration layer (CompilerConfig)\n- Fn/Build and Fn/Bundle execution modes\n- The Output esbuild integration via RestPlugin\n- Artifact consumers (Sky UI, Cocoon extension host)\n\nThis gives new contributors and maintainers a visual reference for how Rest fits into the editor build pipeline, complementing the existing textual description section.",
